{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, robot approaches it. Then, if at station, moves to next one. Finally, scans area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = IsRobotAtStation    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextStation    /> <Action ID = TakeObjectTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = TakeObjectTask    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
